    "tagLine": "12 Months Complimentary Broadband included!",
    "location": "Dublin on your doorstep\n\nSandymount Strand and the sweep of Dublin Bay to one side. Grand Canal Dock and the city centre within easy reach on the other. Glass Bottle sits at one of Dublin's most sought-after addresses — where the energy of the city meets the calm of coastal living.\n\nWalk to Sandymount beach, cycle the coastal routes with Moby Bikes stations at your door, or jump on the 82 and S2 bus routes right outside Glass Bottle for the city centre. When you need to go further afield, a Hertz Car Share is on site. Add to that some of Dublin's best restaurants and cafés, and the open space of Irishtown Nature Reserve on your doorstep, and you have a location that's genuinely hard to beat. This is a place that works as hard as you do — and knows when to slow down."
  },
