  "description": "Bright, spacious and built for how you actually live. The two-bedroom apartment gives you genuine room to breathe — whether you're sharing with a partner, a friend, or simply want a dedicated home office. Both bedrooms have generous fitted wardrobes, and you benefit from both a main bathroom and an en-suite, each with a rainfall shower. The open-plan living and kitchen area is fully furnished with a luxurious sofa, dining space and Neff appliances throughout. Every apartment includes a private balcony or terrace.",
